From 89dfb749106108f8504bcf8a865e1a8383978cb9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:41:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Sony Infrared integration

Controls Sony TVs through an infrared emitter, using the SonyTVCode table
from infrared-protocols. This first version adds the TV device type with a
media player: power, volume, mute and channel up and down.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
